      347.52,
      561.96,
      446.63
    ],
    "text": "North: Lot No. 01 of B.P.Maha - 1527, Lot No. 01 of thesame plan & Ambalampitiyawatte & HapugodadeniyaKumbura claimed by M.O.A. Kareem & Others; East: Road;South: Ambalampitiyawatte & Hapugodadeniya Kumburaclaimed by A.C.M. Fawsan & Ambalampitiyawatte &Hapugodadeniya Kumbura claimed by R.R.M. Punchibanda;West: Ambalampitiyawatte & Hapugodadeniya Kumburaclaimed by R.R.M. Punchibanda & Lot No. 01 B.P.Maha -1527. Owner of the land: Not Known.",
    "fonts": [
