    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      459.36,
      562.07,
      558.23
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are requiredto appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writingat Divisional Secretary's Office, Akurana, on the 01.02.2019 at10.00 am, and hereby requested to notify to me in writing (induplicate) on or before the day of 21.02.2019 the nature oftheir interests in the land and the particulars of their claimsfor compensation for the acquisition of the aforesaid land theamount of compensation and the details of the computation ofsuch amount.",
